#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:1
msgid "Selection semantics"
msgstr "选择语义"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:3
msgid ""
"The selection model defines which checkpoint weights are transformed and "
"which are left unselected. It is designed to make broad architecture-"
"aware selection easy while still allowing name-based control when needed."
msgstr "选择模型定义哪些 checkpoint 权重会被转换、哪些保持未选中。它旨在简化面向架构的广泛选择，同时在需要时仍允许基于名称进行控制。"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:5
msgid "Selector inputs"
msgstr "选择器输入"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:7
msgid "A selection can come from:"
msgstr "选择可以来自："

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:9
msgid "built-in selectors passed with `--select`."
msgstr "通过 `--select` 传入的内置选择器。"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:10
msgid "regex patterns passed with `--select-name`."
msgstr "通过 `--select-name` 传入的正则表达式模式。"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:11
msgid "exclusions passed with `--exclude`."
msgstr "通过 `--exclude` 传入的排除项。"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:12
msgid "regex exclusions passed with `--exclude-name`."
msgstr "通过 `--exclude-name` 传入的正则排除项。"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:13
msgid "recipe `select` entries."
msgstr "recipe 中的 `select` 条目。"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:15
msgid ""
"Selections from the CLI and recipe are merged. Explicit CLI parameters "
"can override recipe settings for scalar quantization options."
msgstr "来自 CLI 和 recipe 的选择会被合并。对于标量量化选项，显式 CLI 参数可以覆盖 recipe 设置。"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:17
msgid "Union then subtraction"
msgstr "先并集后差集"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:19
msgid "The selected set is built in two steps:"
msgstr "选中集合分两步构建："

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:21
msgid "`--select` and `--select-name` add weights to the candidate set."
msgstr "`--select` 和 `--select-name` 将权重加入候选集合。"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:22
msgid "`--exclude` and `--exclude-name` remove weights from that candidate set."
msgstr "`--exclude` 和 `--exclude-name` 从候选集合中移除权重。"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:24
msgid "This makes broad selection plus narrow exclusion possible."
msgstr "这样即可实现广泛选择与精细排除。"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:26
msgid "Why built-in selectors matter"
msgstr "内置选择器的重要性"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:28
msgid ""
"Built-in selectors encode knowledge about supported model families and "
"fused layouts. They are safer than regex when a model contains:"
msgstr "内置选择器编码了对受支持模型家族和融合布局的知识。当模型包含以下内容时，它们比正则表达式更安全："

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:30
msgid "MoE routed expert banks."
msgstr "MoE 路由专家权重组。"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:31
msgid "shared experts."
msgstr "共享专家。"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:32
msgid "MLA-style attention projections."
msgstr "MLA 风格的注意力投影。"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:33
msgid "fused gate/up/down expert tensors."
msgstr "融合的 gate/up/down 专家张量。"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:35
msgid ""
"A regex can match a name, but it does not by itself prove that the "
"resulting set is a safe inference unit."
msgstr "正则表达式可以匹配名称，但本身不能证明所得集合是安全的推理单元。"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:37
msgid "Fused-unit boundary"
msgstr "融合单元边界"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:39
msgid ""
"Some tensors are consumed together by inference kernels. Splitting them "
"can produce an output that is structurally inconsistent or not loadable."
msgstr "某些张量会被推理内核一起使用。拆分它们可能产生结构不一致或无法加载的输出。"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:41
msgid "Examples include:"
msgstr "示例包括："

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:43
msgid "MLA-style projection pairs."
msgstr "MLA 风格的投影对。"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:44
msgid "gate/up/down projections inside expert banks."
msgstr "专家权重组内的 gate/up/down 投影。"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:45
msgid "partial experts inside routed expert groups."
msgstr "路由专家组内的部分专家。"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:47
msgid ""
"The selection model therefore treats fused groups as boundaries that "
"should be selected together."
msgstr "因此，选择模型将融合组视为应当一起选择的边界。"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:49
msgid "Dry-run as selection review"
msgstr "将空运行作为选择审查"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:51
msgid ""
"Dry-run mode is the selection review step. It lets you check selected "
"counts, unmatched selectors, layout constraints, and fused-unit "
"constraints before writing weights."
msgstr "空运行模式是选择审查步骤。它允许你在写入权重之前检查选中数量、未匹配的选择器、布局约束和融合单元约束。"

#: ../../source/explanation/selection-semantics.md:53
msgid ""
"A quantization command should not be considered ready until its dry-run "
"output matches the intended selection."
msgstr "在空运行输出与预期选择一致之前，不应认为量化命令已经准备就绪。"
